pan class="enc-name">George II of Brieg</span><span class="enc-type">Person</span><span class="enc-snip">George II of Brieg was a Silesian Piast duke who ruled Brzeg from 1547.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/george-ii-of-great-britain"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/george-ii-of-great-britain.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">George II of Great Britain</span><span class="enc-type">Person</span><span class="enc-snip">George II was king of Great Britain and Elector of Hanover from 1727 to 1760.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/george-ii-of-greece"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/george-ii-of-greece.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">George II of Greece</span><span class="enc-type">Person</span><span class="enc-snip">George II of Greece was king from 1922 to 1924 and again from 1935 to 1947.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/george-ii-rakoczi"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/george-ii-rakoczi.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">George II Rákóczi</span><span class="enc-type">Person</span><span class="enc-snip">George II Rákóczi was Prince of Transylvania from 1648.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/george-ii-duke-of-saxe-meiningen"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/george-ii-duke-of-saxe-meiningen.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">George II, Duke of Saxe-Meiningen</span><span class="enc-type">Person</span><span class="enc-snip">George II, Duke of Saxe-Meiningen, came to power in 1866 when Prussia deposed his father for siding with Austria.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/george-iii"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/george-iii.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height=