 a Manx-born British administrator who merged rival trading firms on the Niger into the United African Company in 1879.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/george-the-pious"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/george-the-pious.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">George the Pious</span><span class="enc-type">Person</span><span class="enc-snip">George the Pious was Margrave of Brandenburg-Ansbach from 1515 to 1543, a member of the Franconian Hohenzollerns.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/george-town-cayman-islands"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/george-town-cayman-islands.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">George Town, Cayman Islands</span><span class="enc-type">Place</span><span class="enc-snip">George Town is the capital of the Cayman Islands, a British Overseas Territory in the western Caribbean, on the west coast of Grand Cayman.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/george-town-penang"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/george-town-penang.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">George Town, Penang</span><span class="enc-type">Place</span><span class="enc-snip">George Town, Penang, was founded by Francis Light of the East India Company in 1786 on the island he renamed Prince of Wales Island.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/george-tupou-i"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/george-tupou-i.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">George Tupou I</span><span class="enc-type">Person</span><span class="enc-snip">George Tupou I, born Tāufaʻāhau, was a chief from Haʻapai who converted to Wesleyan Christianity and united Tonga through civil wars, ruling as king from 1845.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/george-v"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/george-v.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">George V</span><span class="enc-type">Person</span><span class="enc-snip">George V was King of the United Kingdom and emperor of India from 1910 to 1936.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/george-v-of-hanover"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/george-v-of-hanover.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">George V of Hanover</span><span class="enc-type">Person</span><span class="enc-snip">George V of Hanover was the last king of Hanover, reigning from 1851 to 1866.</span></a></li></ul>
